    <Placemark>
      <name>Cabaret</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Cabaret</b><br><i>Theatre</i><br>Tue 2nd Jun<br>Kit Kat Club at the Playhouse, West End<br>from £65<br><br>Step into 1930s Berlin at the transformed Playhouse Theatre. Enjoy the vibrant and turbulent world of Cabaret, a show that has captivated London’s theatre scene.<br><br><a href="https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/shows-tonight">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
