      <description><![CDATA[<b>Moulin Rouge! The Musical</b><br><i>Theatre</i><br>Tue 2nd Jun<br>Piccadilly Theatre, West End<br>from £48<br><br>Experience a breathtaking celebration of love and art. Moulin Rouge! The Musical brings the iconic story to life with spectacular performances and dazzling costumes.<br><br><a href="https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/shows-tonight">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
