      <description><![CDATA[<b>Moco Museum London + Cocktail</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Tue 2nd Jun – Sun 7th Jun<br>Moco Museum London, London<br>from £26<br><br>Explore more than 100 modern, contemporary, digital and immersive works at Moco Museum London, then finish with a cocktail at The Cumberland's SOUND Cafe and Bar.<br><br><a href="https://feverup.com/m/364373">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
