    <Placemark>
      <name>The Definitive Rat Pack</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>The Definitive Rat Pack</b><br><i>Music</i><br>Tue 2nd Jun – Tue 30th Jun<br>Boisdale of Canary Wharf, Canary Wharf<br>from £52.92 – £99.64<br><br>Enjoy the music and chemistry of Sinatra, Martin, and Davis in The Definitive Rat Pack. This show features sharp phrasing, relaxed delivery, and moments of spontaneity, with a set list including &quot;That’s Life&quot; and &quot;Mr. Bojangles&quot;.<br><br><a href="https://boisdalecanarywharf.designmynight.com/69dfc30ab064a97589676694/the-definitive-rat-pack-15">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
