      <description><![CDATA[<b>David Bowie: You’re Not Alone</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Wed 22nd Apr – Sun 28th Jun<br>Lightroom, London<br>Free<br><br>Step into the world of David Bowie with this immersive exhibition. It features rare concert footage shown through 360-degree projections and clips, offering a unique look at the iconic performer's career.<br><br><a href="https://secretldn.com/things-to-do-london-april-2026/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
