      <description><![CDATA[<b>Curating at Home: Making Personal Spaces</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Sun 10th May – Tue 9th Jun<br>IMT Gallery, London<br>£115<br><br>Join a four-session online course exploring how art shapes our personal spaces. This course will help you understand how to live with art and make your home a creative haven.<br><br><a href="https://eventsforlondon.co.uk/event/curating-at-home-making-personal-spaces-of-creative-agency-with-dr-mark-rohtmaa-jackson/2026-05-10/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
